.TH "libnvmf_config_free" 9 "libnvmf_config_free" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvmf_config_free \- release a resolved configuration.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" libnvmf_config_free
.BI "(struct libnvmf_config *config "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "config" 12
configuration to free; NULL is a no-op.
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Invalidates every connection and parameter set obtained from \fIconfig\fP.
